---
import { Container } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <Container>
    <section class="page-shell">
      <div class="title-block">
        <p class="eyebrow">Mobile App Development Services</p>
        <h1>Mobile App Development Services</h1>
      </div>

      <p class="lead">
        At <strong>Linkly LLC</strong>, we craft high-performing, cross-platform
        mobile applications for iOS and Android that deliver native-grade
        experiences. By leveraging modern cross-platform frameworks, we help you
        launch feature-rich mobile products faster, reducing time-to-market and
        development costs without sacrificing performance or design.
      </p>

      <div class="section-block">
        <h2>What We Build</h2>
        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>1. Cross-Platform Mobile Applications</h3>
            <p>
              Single-codebase mobile apps engineered to run seamlessly across both
              iOS and Android platforms. Enjoy full native device functionality,
              identical performance, and streamlined long-term codebase
              maintenance.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>2. Consumer Apps &amp; Digital Products</h3>
            <p>
              Engaging, intuitive mobile experiences designed with consumer
              retention in mind. We build feature-packed mobile solutions
              incorporating real-time messaging, push notifications, offline
              storage, biometrics, and secure payment integrations.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>3. Enterprise Mobile Solutions</h3>
            <p>
              Secure mobile tools built for field staff, remote teams, and
              enterprise operational management. We build custom dashboards, field
              data collection applications, and employee productivity suites linked
              directly to your core backend.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>4. App Modernization &amp; Refactoring</h3>
            <p>
              Update outdated legacy mobile applications to contemporary cross-platform
              architectures. We improve UI responsiveness, fix underlying memory leaks,
              and upgrade third-party API dependencies for seamless app store compliance.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-block">
        <h2>Core Technologies</h2>
        <div class="tech-grid">
          <article class="tech-card">
            <h3>React Native</h3>
            <p>
              JavaScript Mobile Framework — Native UI components, fast feature
              iteration, massive community ecosystem, and shared web/mobile logic.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="tech-card">
            <h3>Flutter</h3>
            <p>
              Dart Multi-Platform Engine — High-performance graphics rendering,
              flexible custom UI widgets, consistent visual fidelity across all
              screen sizes, and native execution speed.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-block">
        <h2>How We Deliver: Our Mobile Engineering Process</h2>
        <ol class="process-list">
          <li>
            <strong>UX/UI Mobile Prototyping</strong>
            <p>
              We design touch-first wireframes and interactive prototypes aligned
              with Apple Human Interface Guidelines and Google Material Design
              standardizations.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cross-Platform Engineering</strong>
            <p>
              We write clean, modular React Native or Flutter codebases backed by
              offline-first data synchronization and robust state management.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Device Feature Integration</strong>
            <p>
              We tap into native hardware APIs including camera modules, GPS,
              Bluetooth, biometric authentication, push notification engines, and
              local storage.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Quality Assurance &amp; Device Testing</strong>
            <p>
              Comprehensive testing across physical smartphones, tablets, screen
              resolutions, OS versions, and varying network speeds.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>App Store Deployment &amp; Support</strong>
            <p>
              We manage the entire submission process for the Apple App Store and
              Google Play Store, handling compliance reviews, signing
              certificates, and post-launch updates.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-shell {
    margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
    max-width: 1100px;
  }

  .title-block {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--theme-accent);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-block {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .service-grid,
  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-card,
  .tech-card {
    background: var(--theme-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
    padding: 28px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .service-card h3,
  .tech-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem);
  }

  .service-card p,
  .tech-card p,
  .process-list p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .process-list {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
  }

  .process-list li + li {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .service-grid,
    .tech-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
